<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate Brands raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate Brands raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Intimate Brands Inc to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Intimate Brands gained 5/8 to 19-5/8.</p>
</text>
